    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「おらも、ちょっと新鮮だなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「故郷では子供の人数足りなくて、学校はいろんな年代のひとの寄せ集めだったがら」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「同い年ぐらいのひとだけ、ってのが不思議な感じだぁ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「この学校で、おらたちはどんな青春を過ごすのがなぁ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「そんな機会はないよ、きっと。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「復学の手続きとかしにきたけどさぁ、今年もいろいろ仕事あるし。まともに通えないよ、絶対に」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「ずっとそうだったもん、あたしは。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「あたしたちは『ふつうの女の子』じゃないの、アイドルなんだよ？　わかってる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
