    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「ふつうの幸せを求めちゃいけねぇ、わけじゃねぇと思うだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「つばさしゃんは、『アイドル』以外のことぜんぶ切り捨ててるみたいで心配だぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「でっかいお世話。ことりんこそアイドルの自覚ないんじゃないの、浮かれちゃってさ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「ここに通って、ふつうの高校生をする人生もあったかもしれない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「そういう夢だよ、夢だから現実じゃないの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「現実を見ないとね、ことりん。生き馬の目を抜くアイドル業界、油断すると食い殺されるよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「はぁい。でも今日はもうお仕事ねぇんだろ、オフを利用して手続きと挨拶しにきたんだもんな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「校内、見学していかねぇが？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「駄目駄目、誰かに見つかって騒ぎになったらど～すんの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「こんな『ふつうの学校』じゃさ、アイドルなんて異分子だよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「騒ぎを起こしたら、事務所にも迷惑がかかる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「あたしたちmerry-melodyはまだ羽ばたき始めたばかり、変なケチつけられたくないじゃない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
