    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「ん～……つばさしゃんがそう言うなら、おらは従うけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「アイドルについては、つばさしゃんのほうが経験ほうふだし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「でも『ふつうの女の子』の幸せについては、おらのほうが……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「おら、つばさしゃんにもらったぶんだけでも恩返しがしてぇんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「いろんなこと、教えてあげたい。おらなんかが、畏れおおいけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「ことりんの気持ちは嬉しいよ、涙がでちゃうぐらい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「いろんな手続きとかして、籍をおいてるだけだった君咲学院への復学とか……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「段取りつけるために、がんばってくれたのも知ってる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「うちのアホな両親とも電話とかで何度も話しあってさ、苦労してさ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「でも、あたしってそんなに不幸？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「アイドルとして活躍してる、たぶん成功もする。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「メリメロは高くまで羽ばたけるよ、ふたり一緒なら」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「そのために、飛ぶために不必要な重荷は捨てちゃいたいの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「ことりんだけがいればいい、他には何もいらない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
